01:53:58.890 --> 01:54:00.325
me and my mother's voice

01:54:00.325 --> 01:54:03.925
snapping at me to get up.

01:54:03.928 --> 01:54:04.663
She disappeared into the next

01:54:04.663 --> 01:54:07.733
room and I heard the muffled

01:54:07.733 --> 01:54:08.400
sounds of adults arguing at the

01:54:08.400 --> 01:54:09.340
