01:54:32.758 --> 01:54:35.794
My mother told us she would be

01:54:35.794 --> 01:54:36.428
right back and disappeared

01:54:36.428 --> 01:54:38.828
inside leaving my younger

01:54:39.598 --> 01:54:43.198
sister and I in the car.

01:54:43.669 --> 01:54:44.403
I don't know exactly when it

01:54:44.403 --> 01:54:48.300
