04:38:24.919 --> 04:38:25.721
Established in 1980 cv iwc

04:38:25.721 --> 04:38:29.321
specialized in the sale of fine

04:38:29.725 --> 04:38:30.626
californian wines.

04:38:30.626 --> 04:38:31.327
Joe and his partner boyd swartz

04:38:31.327 --> 04:38:33.495
envisioned the store as more

04:38:33.495 --> 04:38:34.129
