04:52:18.898 --> 04:52:19.632
Colleagues, I have two items to

04:52:19.632 --> 04:52:22.268
introduce and one in memoriam.

04:52:22.268 --> 04:52:22.969
First time today introducing

04:52:22.969 --> 04:52:25.369
the recovery first ordinance

04:52:25.572 --> 04:52:26.273
legislation that seeks to

04:52:26.273 --> 04:52:26.907
provide a clear and unifying

04:52:26.907 --> 04:52:29.307
policy directive for city

04:52:29.676 --> 04:52:30.444
agencies and contractors whose

04:52:30.444 --> 04:52:33.120
services relate to illicit drug

04:52:33.120 --> 04:52:33.547
use or to mitigating its myriad

04:52:33.547 --> 04:52:35.547
and deadly harms.

04:52:37.317 --> 04:52:37.984
This straightforward policy

04:52:37.984 --> 04:52:40.384
directive will provide as

04:52:41.287 --> 04:52:42.550
follows that the cessation of

04:52:42.550 --> 04:52:42.756
illicit drug use and attainment

04:52:42.756 --> 04:52:45.426
of long term recovery from

04:52:45.426 --> 04:52:46.160
substance use disorders shall

04:52:46.160 --> 04:52:46.693
be the primary objective of the

04:52:46.693 --> 04:52:48.693
city's drug policy.

04:52:49.696 --> 04:52:50.364
Now in some ways this isn't

04:52:50.364 --> 04:52:51.980
different from the current

04:52:51.980 --> 04:52:53.500
approach of our department of

04:52:53.500 --> 04:52:54.134
public health all drug

04:52:54.134 --> 04:52:56.134
treatment program offers

04:52:57.604 --> 04:52:58.171
in fact aim to help people stop

04:52:58.171 --> 04:53:00.171
using illicit drugs.

04:53:00.808 --> 04:53:01.408
But I have increasingly been

04:53:01.408 --> 04:53:02.109
made aware of instances

04:53:02.109 --> 04:53:05.450
in which some public health

04:53:05.450 --> 04:53:05.746
contractors seem to be rowing

04:53:05.746 --> 04:53:06.513
in a different direction and I

04:53:06.513 --> 04:53:08.913
think that became particularly

04:53:09.816 --> 04:53:10.517
clear to me at a sponsored

04:53:10.517 --> 04:53:12.917
overdose prevention summit I

04:53:13.353 --> 04:53:14.870
attended last month.

04:53:14.870 --> 04:53:16.487
One unfortunate consequence of

04:53:17.291 --> 04:53:17.959
approaches that too often seem

04:53:17.959 --> 04:53:18.759
at cross-purposes with one

04:53:18.759 --> 04:53:21.280
another is that it causes more

04:53:21.280 --> 04:53:21.796
and more san franciscans to

04:53:21.796 --> 04:53:24.796
lose confidence in our approach

04:53:25.132 --> 04:53:25.866
to a drug crisis that is

04:53:25.866 --> 04:53:28.769
costing far too many lives and

04:53:28.769 --> 04:53:29.503
that is taking far too great a

04:53:29.503 --> 04:53:30.237
toll on our city and its

04:53:30.237 --> 04:53:32.637
neighborhoods until long term

04:53:32.973 --> 04:53:33.674
recovery from addiction is

04:53:33.674 --> 04:53:34.174
universally embraced as our

04:53:34.174 --> 04:53:36.174
shared civic goal.

04:53:36.744 --> 04:53:37.512
I fear that our overdose

04:53:37.512 --> 04:53:40.512
prevention plans will be little

04:53:40.681 --> 04:53:40.982
more than overdose postponement

04:53:40.982 --> 04:53:41.516
plans.

04:53:41.516 --> 04:53:43.916
I have been open

04:53:44.652 --> 04:53:45.286
in acknowledging my own journey

04:53:45.286 --> 04:53:46.530
and recovery from drug

04:53:46.530 --> 04:53:48.489
addiction as my primary reason

04:53:48.489 --> 04:53:49.190
for seeking this job and I

04:53:49.190 --> 04:53:51.458
strongly believe that in much

04:53:51.458 --> 04:53:51.992
the way that transit first

04:53:51.992 --> 04:53:52.661
animated our city's

04:53:52.661 --> 04:53:54.661
aspirational urban urbanist

04:53:58.600 --> 04:53:59.367
vision five decades ago a

04:53:59.367 --> 04:54:00.680
