04:54:14.749 --> 04:54:16.749
profitable, more potently

04:54:16.785 --> 04:54:17.552
addictive and deadlier than

04:54:17.552 --> 04:54:18.286
ever before in human history, I

04:54:18.286 --> 04:54:20.855
think it is time to put

04:54:20.855 --> 04:54:21.689
recovery first.

04:54:21.689 --> 04:54:24.258
And I'm grateful to the early

04:54:24.258 --> 04:54:24.859
